DESCRIPTION >
    Successful agent usage by caller and creator username, from existing events.
    Sticky flags avoid scanning generation history on each quest refresh.

TOKEN tinybird_read READ

SCHEMA >
    `user_id` String,
    `owner_username` String,
    `used_agent` AggregateFunction(max, UInt8)

ENGINE AggregatingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY user_id, owner_username
